# Operator commands inside a running container (design §11.4). No shell is needed:
#   kubectl exec <pod> -- java @/app/jvm.options @/app/container.options @/app/admin.args status --operator alice
# (--operator, because kubectl exec can't set an environment variable.) A small heap, so it fits beside the connector.
-Xmx512m
-jar
/app/app.jar
admin
